Why excluded from this ticket's verdict:
- endpoint=null: not an API/network failure path.
- Entire stack trace is inside Flutter framework internals
  (Element/BuildOwner reassemble bookkeeping) -- zero frames in app code,
  and definitely none in select_location_view_widget.dart (the fix's only
  touched file).
- Matches the app's OWN documented locale-switch mechanism
  (docs/platform/localization.md), which deliberately calls
  engine.performReassemble() on every in-app language switch to force
  const-widget refresh -- this fires on ANY locale switch app-wide, not
  specific to the Vendor Registration / Location Info surface.
- assert() is stripped in release builds; debug-mode-only artifact.
- App did not crash / red-screen; RTL demonstration (pixel measurement of
  the search-hint mirroring) succeeded cleanly in the very next actions.
